        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiyama naatae te nkang naji Kana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e uni neetae apa enkiyama te Kana e Galilaya: netii ng'otonye e Yesu ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipotoki sii Yesu o looiteng'eni lenyena te ina kiyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee emita enaisho oo sabibu nejoki ng'otonye Yesu, “Meetae enaisho o sabibu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu, “Na kitok, kaa kiatayie neton eng'or enkata ai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ng'otonye laisiaayiak, “Entaas pooki najoki intae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii ine iltooi loo soito, naa iloo mboreitin are aashu uni obo, netushumaki te ine to lkerreti le nkitukuore oo Lyahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Emputa iltooi enkare.” Neiput metabaiki nkutukie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ajoki, “Entooku enkiti, eyaki olaitasheikinoni lele sirua.” Neyaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eishamisham olkitok le nkiyama enaduoo are naitaaki enaisho oo sabibu, nemeyiolo eneing'uaa, hoo neyiolo laduoo sinkan ootookokito enkare, neipot olkitok le nkiyama oloyamisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki, “Eng'as oshi ake pooki ng'ae aishoru enaisho oo sabibu sidai ore etookishoteki, neishoru eneme sidai oleng; imboo iyie idia sidai o taata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atua Kana e Galilaya etaasie Yesu ena anaa enkiterunoto oo nkitoduaat, neitoduaaya enkitoo enye; neiruk ilooiteng'eni lenyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
